WEBVTT

00:02.540 --> 00:05.440
<i>Dad's seemed really busy lately.</i>

00:05.440 --> 00:09.600
<i>Well, I'm fine with that. 
It means no sword lessons.</i>

00:09.600 --> 00:12.050
Bring all the bandages and antiseptic we have!

00:12.050 --> 00:14.560
<i>Huh? What's all the commotion?</i>

00:19.690 --> 00:22.590
Send for everyone we have 
who can use healing magic!

00:23.650 --> 00:25.150
Over here, too!

00:25.150 --> 00:26.880
Those with severe wounds come first!

00:32.150 --> 00:33.200
What happened here?

00:34.250 --> 00:36.540
I had kept it a secret from you,

00:36.540 --> 00:40.500
but there's been a rash of attacks 
from thieves in our province.

00:41.030 --> 00:43.690
We received intelligence about their 
base and were headed there

00:43.690 --> 00:46.480
when they ambushed us from behind.

00:47.360 --> 00:48.890
We had exercised caution.

00:49.450 --> 00:51.040
Made all necessary preparations.

00:51.900 --> 00:55.470
I swore to take no prisoners, 
but look at us now!

00:55.910 --> 00:57.530
How humiliating!

01:00.630 --> 01:01.870
Haruto.

01:01.870 --> 01:04.940
This must be a grisly sight 
to behold at your young age.

01:05.980 --> 01:07.660
Don't feel obliged to stay. Go back inside.

01:14.970 --> 01:17.310
Done in by a band of thieves?

01:17.310 --> 01:19.620
That blasted Gold is utterly useless!

01:19.890 --> 01:20.800
Flay.

01:22.060 --> 01:23.020
Shut your mouth.

01:30.970 --> 01:32.880
You there! Hurry up!

01:36.610 --> 01:37.390
Huh?!

01:46.150 --> 01:48.580
My leg is in one piece again!

01:49.550 --> 01:50.750
Incredible!

01:51.580 --> 01:52.610
Look at this!

01:52.610 --> 01:54.490
What in the world?

02:14.480 --> 02:17.860
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

03:28.060 --> 03:34.060
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

03:28.060 --> 03:34.060
Episode 2

03:28.060 --> 03:34.060
<b>Char Hates Me</b>

03:38.920 --> 03:39.680
Huh?

03:40.560 --> 03:43.400
Wait, have you been out 
here this whole time?

03:44.710 --> 03:46.220
Are you listening, Flay?!

03:48.090 --> 03:49.390
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

03:49.390 --> 03:53.120
<i>Was she waiting for me as I slept 
because of that order I gave her?</i>

03:50.660 --> 03:53.120
<b>Flay, shut your mouth</b>

03:53.650 --> 03:55.290
<i>She sure is stupid...</i>

03:56.040 --> 03:58.090
I lost my temper earlier.

03:58.090 --> 04:00.760
I'm sorry. You can talk.

04:02.400 --> 04:06.160
No, it seems I offended you in some way.

04:06.560 --> 04:08.570
My apologies.

04:09.210 --> 04:11.300
<i>She doesn't know why I was mad?!</i>

04:11.840 --> 04:13.560
Can you come with me for a minute?

04:13.560 --> 04:14.770
Of course!

04:19.980 --> 04:23.650
We need to start by finding the 
guys who attacked Dad and his men.

04:35.560 --> 04:37.900
These guys mostly look like thieves,

04:37.900 --> 04:39.390
but some are normal soldiers.

04:40.050 --> 04:43.790
Could this be the spot where 
our men were ambushed?

04:44.040 --> 04:47.810
Don't you think the enemy must 
have known we were coming?

04:48.240 --> 04:49.620
You mean a spy?

04:51.080 --> 04:52.020
Let's wipe them out.

04:52.020 --> 04:53.290
Every last one of them.

04:53.290 --> 04:53.930
Yes!

05:12.330 --> 05:15.260
Excellent work out there, Captain!

05:15.260 --> 05:17.430
I told you to call me Boss here.

05:17.430 --> 05:21.550
Just remembering the flustered look 
on the Earth-Shattering Warhammer

05:21.550 --> 05:23.500
makes this booze taste all the sweeter!

05:23.500 --> 05:25.630
It's too early to be celebrating.

05:25.630 --> 05:28.130
We <i>did</i> end up letting him get away.

05:28.130 --> 05:31.690
I can't wait to get rid of him 
and return to our homeland!

05:31.690 --> 05:33.440
You said it!

05:33.440 --> 05:35.830
I see. So that's what's going on.

05:37.770 --> 05:39.480
Who goes there?!

05:41.600 --> 05:43.410
I-I can't move!

05:45.300 --> 05:48.450
All I did was freeze you 
in place with barriers.

05:48.450 --> 05:50.960
Barriers?! What nonsense is—

05:50.960 --> 05:52.450
Can you be quiet?

05:55.960 --> 05:59.870
Look, all you have to do 
is answer my questions.

06:00.660 --> 06:03.890
Lie to me, and you'll pay the price.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.470
So that's it.

06:07.470 --> 06:10.570
You're soldiers from the neighboring empire.

06:10.550 --> 06:16.640
The Empire

06:10.550 --> 06:16.640
Border Province

06:10.550 --> 06:16.640
The Kingdom

06:10.870 --> 06:13.880
Infiltrate the kingdom disguised as thieves,

06:13.880 --> 06:16.650
with the goal of causing internal mayhem.

06:16.650 --> 06:19.380
There should have been troops 
guarding the borders.

06:19.380 --> 06:21.450
W-We had an accomplice!

06:21.450 --> 06:22.910
An accomplice?

06:22.910 --> 06:24.660
We don't know anything beyond that!

06:25.100 --> 06:29.660
<i>You'd need to hold more influence 
than Dad to pull that off.</i>

06:30.550 --> 06:34.640
<i>Is there someone in the kingdom 
who's after his life?</i>

06:35.330 --> 06:38.050
We've told you everything we know!

06:38.050 --> 06:40.800
We'll call off this operation!

06:40.800 --> 06:41.900
So please!

06:41.900 --> 06:43.060
I understand.

06:43.060 --> 06:44.660
Thanks for your cooperation.

06:45.930 --> 06:49.570
Flay, could you burn this entire 
fort to the ground?

06:49.570 --> 06:50.300
Yes!

06:51.320 --> 06:54.310
We were simply acting on orders!

06:53.600 --> 06:54.660
Ah...

06:54.660 --> 06:58.350
I really don't give a damn 
about your side of the story.

06:58.350 --> 07:01.690
After all, you were the 
ones who ambushed my dad.

07:02.050 --> 07:05.270
There's no way I'd let 
you go free after that.

07:06.600 --> 07:09.790
This is the price you pay for 
incurring my master's rage.

07:09.790 --> 07:11.310
Taste his vengeance!

07:11.750 --> 07:13.850
S-Somebody help!

07:17.300 --> 07:19.220
The fort is on fire!

07:19.220 --> 07:20.660
Let's get out of here!

07:27.240 --> 07:29.750
Good work out there, Lord Haruto.

07:29.750 --> 07:31.840
Yeah. You, too, Flay.

07:32.570 --> 07:38.700
I don't know much about imperial 
soldiers or conflict between nations.

07:38.700 --> 07:41.570
But they started this fight, 
so I don't have to show mercy.

07:42.260 --> 07:47.270
For now, I'll send Dad an anonymous 
letter explaining what happened today.

07:51.490 --> 07:56.410
We've confirmed that the thieves 
in the fort have been eradicated,

07:56.410 --> 07:57.990
as per the letter.

07:58.350 --> 08:00.620
The entire fort burned to the ground?

08:00.620 --> 08:01.820
Indeed.

08:01.820 --> 08:04.840
It's unclear how many managed to escape,

08:04.840 --> 08:07.580
but the ones we have in 
custody attest to such.

08:08.460 --> 08:12.070
How could the border 
garrison let this happen?

08:12.870 --> 08:15.820
They'll need to be thoroughly investigated.

08:15.820 --> 08:17.300
As you wish.

08:21.330 --> 08:24.270
I figured they were no ordinary thieves,

08:24.270 --> 08:26.490
but to think the Empire was involved...

08:27.440 --> 08:30.520
<i>What I had feared all 
along has come to pass.</i>

08:31.240 --> 08:32.700
Father.

08:32.700 --> 08:35.340
Who took care of the bad guys?

08:35.750 --> 08:37.750
Hmm, who could it be?

08:38.210 --> 08:43.590
The efficiency, lack of compassion, 
and command over fire on display...

08:43.590 --> 08:45.500
It all seems to point to one person.

08:45.870 --> 08:47.900
Huh? What's this about?

08:48.390 --> 08:51.550
Her strength surpasses my own.

08:51.550 --> 08:54.340
She roams the province to establish 
dominance over monsters,

08:54.340 --> 08:57.630
so I figured it might have 
been during one such outing.

09:04.340 --> 09:07.950
Father, I remembered I need to go somewhere!

09:07.950 --> 09:11.140
If you're going to play outside, 
make sure you take someone with you.

09:11.140 --> 09:11.810
Yes!

09:21.180 --> 09:25.090
<i>Just who </i>is<i> Haruto?</i>

09:27.470 --> 09:30.250
Flay, I have a question for you.

09:30.250 --> 09:32.790
Are there two Harutos?!

09:34.210 --> 09:36.510
What are you blathering on about now?

09:37.350 --> 09:39.530
Did you hit your head?

09:39.530 --> 09:41.250
The truth is that last night,

09:41.250 --> 09:46.850
I saw what looked like you and 
Haruto flying through the night,

09:46.850 --> 09:51.100
but I know Haruto doesn't 
have enough mana to fly,

09:51.100 --> 09:53.350
so I went to his room to check.

09:53.350 --> 09:55.750
Haruto was in there,

09:55.750 --> 09:59.370
but I didn't feel his usual scary aura.

09:59.960 --> 10:02.440
What could it all mean?

10:03.600 --> 10:06.500
So you can sense Lord Haruto's power.

10:06.500 --> 10:08.710
I'm impressed, young lady.

10:09.800 --> 10:12.060
What you felt was none other than...

10:12.060 --> 10:14.830
Lord Haruto's extraordinary mana!

10:15.330 --> 10:20.060
He has been blessed with 
immeasurable power from infancy.

10:20.060 --> 10:23.380
It far exceeds human limits!

10:23.380 --> 10:26.800
So much so that a demon like 
me cannot hope to surpass him!

10:27.200 --> 10:31.510
In other words, that's just 
how marvelous Lord Haruto is!

10:32.020 --> 10:35.320
Do you know what Haruto really is?

10:35.650 --> 10:36.870
I certainly do.

10:36.870 --> 10:39.270
But I cannot reveal it.

10:39.820 --> 10:41.090
Young lady.

10:41.090 --> 10:43.450
If you worry too much 
over such trivial matters,

10:43.900 --> 10:45.350
you'll never grow nice and big.

10:52.820 --> 10:55.040
That's what happened earlier.

10:55.040 --> 10:56.560
<i>Is that right?</i>

10:56.560 --> 10:59.510
<i>So Char caught sight of 
us leaving last night.</i>

10:59.840 --> 11:02.980
And<i> she immediately found out
about my clone!</i>

11:03.470 --> 11:06.020
I need to tell
Father about this!

11:03.540 --> 11:06.560
<i>Wait, does she think I'm incredibly fishy?!</i>

11:08.320 --> 11:10.900
<i>Guess I should make some 
surveillance barriers.</i>

11:11.510 --> 11:17.480
<i>I'll also set it up to ring an alarm 
based on what Char is up to and where.</i>

11:17.960 --> 11:22.010
If I may ask, why <i>are 
</i>there two Lord Harutos?

11:22.830 --> 11:24.040
Don't worry about it.

11:27.120 --> 11:30.260
Bathroom... Bathroom...

11:31.300 --> 11:33.200
<i>I knew she'd be there.</i>

11:33.700 --> 11:37.560
<i>What if I just confront her and 
ask why she's spying on me?</i>

11:38.170 --> 11:39.110
<i>Okay!</i>

11:39.640 --> 11:41.700
Hey, Char—

11:47.380 --> 11:49.220
<i>Didn't work, huh?</i>

11:49.570 --> 11:53.230
Haruto! Hurry up and take a bath!

11:56.870 --> 12:00.130
<i>There's no way she'd follow 
me into the bath, right?</i>

12:02.490 --> 12:03.620
<i>So much for that!</i>

12:07.580 --> 12:08.990
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

