6</b>

12:36.810 --> 12:41.730
m 0 0 l 57 0 l 57 90 l 0 90)

12:36.810 --> 12:41.730
<b>Day
7</b>

12:42.360 --> 12:45.330
Mom and Charlotte are going on a trip?

12:45.330 --> 12:48.160
There's an annual festival 
this time of year.

12:48.160 --> 12:52.450
I'm usually the one who makes the journey, 
but they'll be going instead this year.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.740
You should take Flay with you, then.

12:54.740 --> 12:57.200
I haven't seen her around lately.

12:57.200 --> 12:59.550
I thought she was running errands for you.

12:59.930 --> 13:01.510
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

13:01.510 --> 13:06.420
<i>I asked Flay to intimidate the monsters 
so they don't attack towns and villages.</i>

13:07.310 --> 13:10.470
<i>She's more competent than 
I sometimes give her credit for.</i>

13:10.470 --> 13:12.930
I could have sworn I just heard Lord Haruto!

13:15.600 --> 13:17.190
Grr...

13:17.190 --> 13:20.520
<b>Grr...</b>

13:18.140 --> 13:20.020
<i>Those glaring eyes hurt me.</i>

13:26.060 --> 13:28.280
The surveillance barrier I put on Char!

13:29.510 --> 13:31.960
Seriously? This can't be happening!

13:37.520 --> 13:40.120
Lady Natalia, please make your escape!

13:40.120 --> 13:41.250
Now!

13:44.230 --> 13:45.210
Capture them!

13:45.210 --> 13:46.790
Don't let them get away!

13:48.260 --> 13:50.720
<i>What are imperial soldiers doing here?!</i>

13:59.260 --> 14:00.720
Mother!

14:03.410 --> 14:05.280
Mother, that way!

14:05.620 --> 14:06.940
Charlotte?

14:06.940 --> 14:07.960
Hurry!

14:11.170 --> 14:13.290
Looks like you make a right here!

14:13.960 --> 14:16.530
<i>Is someone giving directions to Charlotte?</i>

14:16.530 --> 14:18.010
<i>But how in the world?</i>

14:24.990 --> 14:26.180
Jump down!

14:41.200 --> 14:43.330
<i>I'm almost out of mana!</i>

14:43.330 --> 14:45.530
<i>This is as far as we go!</i>

14:45.960 --> 14:48.310
We're almost there, Mother!

14:48.660 --> 14:51.170
There's supposed to be a place to hide there!

15:02.530 --> 15:05.250
<i>It's overgrown with luminous moss.</i>

15:05.860 --> 15:08.570
<i>There's nowhere to hide when 
it's this bright in here.</i>

15:11.370 --> 15:12.760
Charlotte.

15:12.760 --> 15:16.930
I'm going to go find the person 
who was giving you directions.

15:16.930 --> 15:18.810
They're nearby, aren't they?

15:18.810 --> 15:21.070
I don't know who it might be,

15:21.070 --> 15:23.110
but I'm sure they must be a hero of justice.

15:23.910 --> 15:26.740
A hero of justice?

15:27.010 --> 15:29.780
Someone who punishes evildoers.

15:29.780 --> 15:32.210
I'm going to go and get them.

15:32.680 --> 15:34.840
So you wait right here.

15:34.840 --> 15:36.940
You mustn't make a sound.

15:37.280 --> 15:41.340
D-Don't go, Mother!

15:41.710 --> 15:43.320
Everything's okay.

15:43.320 --> 15:46.270
I'll make sure you're safe.

15:48.810 --> 15:51.700
No... Mother...

15:53.100 --> 15:54.630
Mother!

16:02.080 --> 16:03.850
Illusionary magic?

16:03.850 --> 16:05.430
Such advanced magic...

16:05.430 --> 16:06.330
Over here!

16:08.260 --> 16:09.820
Just the mother?

16:10.300 --> 16:12.350
The child must be nearby!

16:12.350 --> 16:13.180
Find her!

16:13.180 --> 16:14.120
Right away!

16:14.120 --> 16:16.760
<i>I can't let myself be captured here.</i>

16:17.720 --> 16:18.770
<i>In that case...</i>

16:19.160 --> 16:20.920
What do you think you're doing?

16:20.920 --> 16:22.010
If you resist...

16:26.550 --> 16:29.010
<i>I'm so sorry, Gold.</i>

16:29.010 --> 16:30.070
<i>Charlotte.</i>

16:31.600 --> 16:32.740
<i>Haruto.</i>

16:43.220 --> 16:45.000
I was too late.

16:45.000 --> 16:47.310
Flying at top speed wasn't enough!

16:47.670 --> 16:49.020
Ah, damn it!

16:49.020 --> 16:50.370
Now I'm angry!

16:50.370 --> 16:52.040
You've really pissed me off!

16:52.040 --> 16:53.240
Who are you?!

16:53.550 --> 16:54.850
Shut up!

17:00.540 --> 17:03.640
<i>Mother! Mother!</i>

17:06.530 --> 17:08.080
Charlotte.

17:08.080 --> 17:09.880
Your mother is alive.

17:10.750 --> 17:13.680
She's passed out, so watch over her for me.

17:14.740 --> 17:16.800
If you wait here, help will come.

17:17.390 --> 17:19.270
So endure it for a little longer.

17:20.890 --> 17:22.880
<i>This scary aura...</i>

17:22.880 --> 17:24.180
<i>This must be...</i>

17:24.610 --> 17:28.470
<i>But still, he saved us!</i>

17:29.640 --> 17:30.560
<i>So...</i>

17:31.510 --> 17:33.220
Haruto!

17:34.880 --> 17:37.060
H-Hey.

17:40.350 --> 17:41.680
<i>Shoot.</i>

17:41.680 --> 17:44.120
<i>I turned around when she called my name.</i>

17:45.420 --> 17:47.750
H-Haruto...

17:48.280 --> 17:50.720
Are you a hero of justice?

17:51.350 --> 17:52.150
Excuse me?

17:53.250 --> 17:54.820
<i>Um...</i>

17:55.260 --> 17:58.970
<i>I'm already about to lose it at my very 
first conversation with my sister,</i>

17:58.970 --> 18:01.750
<i>but her question is so absurd 
that my brain's gonna shut down!</i>

18:02.750 --> 18:06.260
<i>Welp, might as well play along for now.</i>

18:06.260 --> 18:07.750
Yep, that's right.

18:07.750 --> 18:09.370
I'm a hero of justice.

18:09.370 --> 18:10.270
I knew it!

18:10.270 --> 18:10.820
What?

18:10.820 --> 18:15.520
So you got your powers to 
take care of the bad guys!

18:16.090 --> 18:19.360
Well... Sure, I guess you could say that.

18:19.360 --> 18:21.780
Mother taught me!

18:21.780 --> 18:25.450
A hero of justice is someone 
who punishes evildoers!

18:28.290 --> 18:30.090
How could I be so foolish?

18:30.090 --> 18:33.810
I've been wrong about you this whole time!

18:33.810 --> 18:36.330
Oh, you have to keep this a secret.

18:36.330 --> 18:38.500
No one can know my true identity.

18:38.500 --> 18:39.830
If you say so!

18:39.830 --> 18:43.250
I'll have to lie to Father, then!

18:44.410 --> 18:46.770
<i>I feel so guilty now...</i>

18:46.770 --> 18:47.900
<i>Well, moving on.</i>

18:49.390 --> 18:52.740
Okay, I'll go take care of the guys outside.

18:52.740 --> 18:54.070
Of course.

18:54.070 --> 18:56.430
It's your job as a hero of justice, right?

18:58.150 --> 19:00.380
Yeah, let's go with that.

19:05.260 --> 19:08.370
Lady Natalia and Lady Charlotte 
have both escaped harm.

19:08.670 --> 19:12.800
Flay has joined them, and is 
escorting them as we speak.

19:13.310 --> 19:16.430
Additionally, a number of 
bodyguards were injured,

19:16.430 --> 19:18.970
only to be spontaneously healed once again.

19:19.350 --> 19:20.650
I see.

19:20.650 --> 19:23.940
I'd love to thank the person who saved them,

19:23.940 --> 19:26.230
but it seems he has no intention 
of making himself known.

19:27.140 --> 19:29.470
Haruto, what are your 
thoughts on the matter?

19:30.640 --> 19:34.890
Well, I'm sure he'll stay on 
our side as long as we behave.

19:37.310 --> 19:38.690
I suppose.

19:38.690 --> 19:42.290
Charlotte called him a hero of justice,

19:42.290 --> 19:44.950
so we'll just have to wait and see for now.

19:45.320 --> 19:46.850
Yep, yep!

19:46.850 --> 19:49.320
Even if more imperial soldiers 
pretend to be thieves and attack,

19:49.320 --> 19:50.980
I'm sure he'll take care of them for us.

19:50.980 --> 19:53.370
How do you know they were imperial soldiers?

19:54.310 --> 19:58.640
I-I mean, wouldn't real 
thieves be robbing towns?

19:58.640 --> 20:01.430
I figured that was the case 
since they went after Mom...

20:01.880 --> 20:05.220
Huh? But that can't be right!

20:05.220 --> 20:07.090
You tightened security at the borders!

20:07.090 --> 20:09.020
How did they manage to get in here?

20:09.450 --> 20:13.930
Could they have infiltrated the province 
before we increased security?

20:13.930 --> 20:16.040
<i>So close! You almost had it!</i>

20:16.870 --> 20:19.070
Wait, did someone on our 
side help them get in?

20:19.070 --> 20:20.360
That must be it!

20:20.360 --> 20:24.810
Haruto, sometimes I can hardly 
believe you're only nine years old.

20:26.130 --> 20:29.110
<i>Sorry, I'm actually an 
old man on the inside.</i>

20:29.540 --> 20:31.460
That shrewd vixen...

20:31.460 --> 20:33.830
It seems she's finally tipped her hand.

20:34.180 --> 20:35.620
<i>Shrewd vixen?</i>

20:36.160 --> 20:38.720
Father, we're home!

20:38.720 --> 20:40.760
Charlotte! Natalia!

20:42.770 --> 20:44.860
I'm so glad you made it back safely!

20:49.100 --> 20:50.720
Haruto!

20:52.420 --> 20:55.290
Haruto, I missed you!

20:55.290 --> 20:58.510
Oh, since when were you two so friendly?

20:58.510 --> 20:59.690
What's gotten into you?

21:00.100 --> 21:02.220
No, there's no need for concern!

21:02.220 --> 21:04.310
We all have our circumstances,

21:04.310 --> 21:06.940
and I may be a child, 
but it's perfectly fine!

21:07.550 --> 21:10.000
<i>Don't word it so misleadingly!</i>

21:10.960 --> 21:13.590
<i>Look, they're lost for words!</i>

21:13.590 --> 21:18.470
Anyway, I love Haruto now!

21:20.050 --> 21:23.160
Well, isn't that great?

21:24.000 --> 21:27.070
<i>I guess it worked out 
since she likes me now?</i>

21:27.070 --> 21:29.340
<i>Wait, her cheeks rubbing against me...</i>

21:29.340 --> 21:32.060
<i>I like it! I like it a lot!</i>

21:32.060 --> 21:33.670
Stop that, young lady!

21:33.670 --> 21:35.790
Get your hands off Lord Haruto!

23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
Episode Preview

23:09.540 --> 23:10.980
Charlotte here!

23:10.980 --> 23:13.760
My brother has incredible powers...

23:13.760 --> 23:15.340
Oh, wait, that's a secret!

23:15.340 --> 23:18.530
I had to lie to Father, 
so please don't tell him!

23:18.530 --> 23:20.450
Next episode: "Char Adores Me Now".

23:19.500 --> 23:23.990
<b>Char Adores Me Now</b>

23:20.450 --> 23:23.100
Haruto is so amazing!
